    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages command execution with timeout enforcement. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses steady_clock (recommended per benchmark hygiene) to track execution deadlines. When a timeout occurs, the process is terminated gracefully (SIGTERM) followed by forceful termination (SIGKILL) if needed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
